# MASTER PROMPT: BUILD IPU PULSE — THE CAMPUS DISCOVERY PLATFORM FOR IPU COLLEGES

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, product architect, Firebase engineer, and QA tester. Build a complete, responsive, production-minded web application called **IPU Pulse**.

Do not just create a landing page or a static UI mockup. Build a functional application with working navigation, college selection, society listings, event discovery, eligibility information, registration flows, membership applications, authentication, and role-based dashboards.

If your environment supports creating and running files, implement the project directly, run it, test it, and fix errors. Do not stop after writing a plan.

---

# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Product name: IPU Pulse

Tagline: Every College. Every Society. Every Opportunity.

Platform type: College society discovery, campus event discovery, event registration, and society membership platform.

Target audience:
- Students studying in colleges affiliated with Guru Gobind Singh Indraprastha University (GGSIPU/IPU).
- Students interested in fests, hackathons, workshops, orientations, competitions, and society recruitment.
- Society members and authorised society representatives.
- Society presidents and core team members.
- Platform administrators and moderators.

Core problem:

Students often do not know which societies are organising events, when events are happening, whether outsiders can participate, whether registration is open, or how to join a society.

Information is scattered across Instagram pages, WhatsApp groups, posters, college websites, and Google Forms.

IPU Pulse must bring this information into one clean, searchable, centralised platform.

Core product promise:

A student selects their college, discovers its societies, explores active and upcoming events, checks eligibility, registers for events, and finds official society membership information — all from one platform.

IMPORTANT:
- Build a working MVP, not a fake product presentation.
- Keep the interface simple, modern, professional, and intuitive.
- Never invent real upcoming events, phone numbers, official society links, or verified contact information.
- Use clearly labelled demonstration data until genuine information is supplied or verified.
- Do not claim affiliation or official endorsement from IPU or any college unless authorised.

